  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If eyes are actually named \"LeftEye\" and \"RightEye\", VRChat will rotate them incorrectly in-game by about 90 degrees guaranteed.\n\nThe two images below are identical avatars in every way (bone rotations, muscle settings, bone weights, visemes, etc) besides for the one with the working eyes has their eye bones named \"RealLeftEye\" and \"RealRightEye\".\n\nVRChat must have something like a bug in the eye-tracking script that causes this, its the only explanation I can think of.",
